#. module: ems
#: model:mail.template,body_html:ems.email_template_enrollment_send
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>Dear <strong t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            We are writing to inform you that the enrollment proposal for the upcoming academic year\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.ems_course_id.name\"/> is now available.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>To complete the enrollment, please follow these steps:</p>\n"
"                        <ol>\n"
"                            <li>Access the school portal: <a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.get_base_url() }}/ca/my/gestion-matriculas\">my enrollment</a></li>\n"
"                            <li>Respond to the required authorizations.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Review the enrollment fees.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Review the possible discounts or exemptions (CFGS).</li>\n"
"                            <li>Select the payment method.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Click the <strong>Final Confirmation</strong> button.</li>\n"
"                        </ol>\n"
"                        <p>A more detailed manual is available: <a t-attf-href=\"https://docs.ems.elpuig.xeill.net/ca/families/manual-confirmacio-matricula.html\">Guide to confirm the enrollment proposal.</a></p>\n"
"                        <p><strong>Note for higher-level VET (CFGS) students:</strong> <em>Higher-level vocational training fees may qualify for a 50% discount or even a 100% exemption if you meet these requirements; send us the documentation from the student portal <strong>before</strong> confirming the enrollment:</em></p>\n"
"                        <ul>\n"
"                            <li>Large family</li>\n"
"                            <li>Single-parent family</li>\n"
"                            <li>MEC grant</li>\n"
"                            <li>Disability &gt; 33%</li>\n"
"                            <li>Others (Batxillerat honours enrolment, gender-based violence, minimum income, Batxillerat award, VET award, ...)</li>\n"
"                        </ul>\n"
"                        <p><em>Note: If you notice any issue or have any questions about the fees, you can send a comment to the Secretariat directly from the portal before confirming.</em></p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Kind regards,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\"><br/>📞 <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/></t>\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\"><br/>✉️ <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/></t>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>"
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>Estimado/a <strong t-out=\"object.partner_id.name\"/>,</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Nos ponemos en contacto con usted para informar que la propuesta de matrícula para el próximo curso\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.ems_course_id.name\"/> ya está disponible.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>Para completar la matrícula, siga los siguientes pasos:</p>\n"
"                        <ol>\n"
"                            <li>Acceda al portal del centro: <a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.get_base_url() }}/ca/my/gestion-matriculas\">mi matrícula</a></li>\n"
"                            <li>Responda las autorizaciones requeridas.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Revise los conceptos económicos de la matrícula.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Revise las posibles bonificaciones o exenciones (CFGS).</li>\n"
"                            <li>Seleccione la forma de pago.</li>\n"
"                            <li>Pulse el botón de <strong>Confirmación final</strong>.</li>\n"
"                        </ol>\n"
"                        <p>Dispone de un manual más detallado: <a t-attf-href=\"https://docs.ems.elpuig.xeill.net/ca/families/manual-confirmacio-matricula.html\">Guía para confirmar la propuesta de matrícula.</a></p>\n"
"                        <p><strong>Nota Alumnado CFGS:</strong> <em>Las tasas de los ciclos de grado superior pueden tener una bonificación del 50% o incluso una exención del 100% si estás bajo estos requisitos, envíanos la documentación desde el portal del alumno <strong>antes</strong> de confirmar la matrícula:</em></p>\n"
"                        <ul>\n"
"                            <li>Familia numerosa</li>\n"
"                            <li>Familia monoparental</li>\n"
"                            <li>Beca MEC</li>\n"
"                            <li>Discapacidad &gt; 33%</li>\n"
"                            <li>Otros (matrícula honor Batx, violencia de género, renta mínima, premio Batx, premio FP,...)</li>\n"
"                        </ul>\n"
"                        <p><em>Nota: Si detecta alguna incidencia o tiene alguna duda con los conceptes, puede enviar un comentario a Secretaría desde el mismo portal, antes de confirmar el trámite.</em></p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Atentamente,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.phone\"><br/>📞 <t t-out=\"object.company_id.phone\"/></t>\n"
"                            <t t-if=\"object.company_id.email\"><br/>✉️ <t t-out=\"object.company_id.email\"/></t>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>"

#. module: ems
#: model:mail.template,body_html:ems.mail_attendance_issue_status_family
msgid ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Dear family,\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            This is an automated email, in order to inform you about an attendance status:\n"
"                            </p><ul>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Student:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.student_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Date:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.weekday\"/>, <t t-out=\"object.attendance_session_id.date\"/> from <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.start_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/> to <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.end_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/></li>                                \n"
"                                <li><strong>Session:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.attendance_schedule_id.attendance_template_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Status:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_status_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <t t-if=\"object.notes\">\n"
"                                    <li><strong>Details:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.notes\"/></li>\n"
"                                </t>\n"
"                            </ul>                        \n"
"                        \n"
"                        <p>If you need further information, you can contact with <t t-out=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.attendance_issue_tutor_id.tutor_id.display_name\"/> just replaying to this email.</p>                                                \n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Kind regards,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.create_uid.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Estimada família,\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Este es un correo automático, para informarles sobre una asistencia:\n"
"                            </p><ul>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Estudiante:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.student_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Fecha:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.weekday\"/>, <t t-out=\"object.attendance_session_id.date\"/> de <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.start_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/> a <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.end_time\" t-options=\"{'widget': 'float_time'}\"/></li>                                \n"
"                                <li><strong>Sesión:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_session_id.attendance_schedule_id.attendance_template_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <li><strong>Estado:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.attendance_status_id\"/></li>\n"
"                                <t t-if=\"object.notes\">\n"
"                                    <li><strong>Detalles:</strong> <span t-field=\"object.notes\"/></li>\n"
"                                </t>\n"
"                            </ul>                        \n"
"                        \n"
"                        <p>Si necesita más información, puede contactar con <t t-out=\"object.attendance_issue_student_id.attendance_issue_tutor_id.tutor_id.display_name\"/> contestando a este correo.</p>                                                \n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Saludos cordiales,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.create_uid.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "

