"                            the destinations left at the end.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            Everyone else has already chosen: choose it on the school portal\n"
"                            (<a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.get_base_url() }}/my/erasmus\">Erasmus+</a>) as soon as you can.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Kind regards,<br/>\n"
