"    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px 0;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#596679;\">Hello <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\"/>, now that you are no longer part of the school staff, your corporate Google Workspace account will be deactivated.</p>\n"
