msgstr ": ¿lo ratificáis?"

#. module: ems
#: model:mail.template,body_html:ems.email_template_student_walkout_ratify
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>Dear family,</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.student_id.name\"/> has said that they join the student walkout\n"
"                            called by a students' union for <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_id.walkout_date)\"/>,\n"
"                            which their group, <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.group_id.name\"/>, has voted to support.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            As they are a minor, their absence that day is only justified if you ratify their decision.\n"
"                            You can ratify it or refuse it on the school portal\n"
"                            (<a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.get_base_url() }}/my/vagues\">student walkouts</a>) until\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.walkout_id.format_local_datetime(object.walkout_id.join_until)\"/>.\n"
"                            Without your answer by then, it is not justified.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>If you have any question, talk to the group's tutor.</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Kind regards,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>Estimada familia:</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.student_id.name\"/> ha dicho que se suma a la huelga\n"
"                            convocada por un sindicato de estudiantes para el <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_id.walkout_date)\"/>,\n"
"                            que su grupo, <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.group_id.name\"/>, ha votado apoyar.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Como es menor de edad, su falta de ese día solo se justifica si ratificáis su decisión.\n"
"                            Podéis ratificarla o no en el portal del centro\n"
"                            (<a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.get_base_url() }}/my/vagues\">huelgas de estudiantes</a>) hasta el\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.walkout_id.format_local_datetime(object.walkout_id.join_until)\"/>.\n"
"                            Si no hay respuesta antes, no se justifica.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>Si tenéis cualquier duda, hablad con el tutor del grupo.</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Un cordial saludo,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "

#. module: ems
#: model:mail.template,body_html:ems.email_template_student_walkout_ratification_refused
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
