"                        <p>\n"
"                            Your family has not ratified that you join the student walkout of\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_id.walkout_date)\"/>, so your absence that day\n"
"                            will not be justified.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>If you have any question, talk to your tutor.</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Kind regards,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>Hola, <t t-out=\"object.student_id.name\"/>:</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Tu familia no ha ratificado que te sumes a la huelga del\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_id.walkout_date)\"/>, así que tu falta de ese día\n"
"                            no se justificará.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>Si tienes cualquier duda, habla con tu tutor.</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Un cordial saludo,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "

#. module: ems
