#. module: ems
#: model:mail.template,body_html:ems.email_template_student_walkout_family_rejected
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>Dear family,</p>\n"
"                        <p t-if=\"object.walkout_id.rejected_from_state == 'justified'\">\n"
"                            The Head of Studies has withdrawn the validation of the student walkout of\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.group_id.name\"/> on\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_id.walkout_date)\"/>, which\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.student_id.name\"/> had said they joined:\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.walkout_id.rejection_reason_id.name\"/>.\n"
"                            Their absence that day is no longer justified.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p t-elif=\"object.walkout_id.rejected_from_state == 'closed'\">\n"
"                            The Head of Studies has not validated the student walkout of\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.group_id.name\"/> on\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_id.walkout_date)\"/>, which\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.student_id.name\"/> had said they joined:\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.walkout_id.rejection_reason_id.name\"/>.\n"
"                            Their absence that day will not be justified.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            The school has aborted the student walkout proposal of\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.group_id.name\"/> for\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_id.walkout_date)\"/>, which\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.student_id.name\"/> had said they joined:\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.walkout_id.rejection_reason_id.name\"/>.\n"
"                            There is nothing left to ratify, and their absence that day will not be justified.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>If you have any question, talk to the group's tutor.</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Kind regards,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>Estimada familia:</p>\n"
"                        <p t-if=\"object.walkout_id.rejected_from_state == 'justified'\">\n"
"                            Jefatura de estudios ha retirado la validación de la huelga de\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.group_id.name\"/> del\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_id.walkout_date)\"/>, a la que\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.student_id.name\"/> había dicho que se sumaba:\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.walkout_id.rejection_reason_id.name\"/>.\n"
"                            La falta de ese día ya no está justificada.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p t-elif=\"object.walkout_id.rejected_from_state == 'closed'\">\n"
"                            Jefatura de estudios no ha validado la huelga de\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.group_id.name\"/> del\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_id.walkout_date)\"/>, a la que\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.student_id.name\"/> había dicho que se sumaba:\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.walkout_id.rejection_reason_id.name\"/>.\n"
"                            La falta de ese día no se justificará.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p t-else=\"\">\n"
"                            El centro ha anulado la propuesta de apoyo a la huelga de\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.group_id.name\"/> para el\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_id.walkout_date)\"/>, a la que\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.student_id.name\"/> había dicho que se sumaba:\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.walkout_id.rejection_reason_id.name\"/>.\n"
"                            Ya no hay nada que ratificar, y la falta de ese día no se justificará.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p>Si tienen cualquier duda, hablen con el tutor del grupo.</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            Un cordial saludo,<br/>\n"
"                            <t t-out=\"object.walkout_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "

#. module: ems
#: model:mail.template,body_html:ems.email_template_student_walkout_head
msgid ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>Hello,</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            The vote of the student walkout of <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_date)\"/> in\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.group_id.name\"/> has closed. The minute is attached.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <ul>\n"
"                            <li>Group vote: <t t-out=\"object.group_yes_count\"/> yes, <t t-out=\"object.group_no_count\"/> no,\n"
"                                <t t-out=\"object.group_abstain_count\"/> abstentions.\n"
"                                <strong t-if=\"object.group_supports\">The group supports it.</strong>\n"
"                                <strong t-else=\"\">The group does not support it.</strong></li>\n"
"                            <li>Students who join: <t t-out=\"object.joining_count\"/> of <t t-out=\"len(object.line_ids)\"/>;\n"
"                                can be justified: <t t-out=\"len(object.justifiable_student_ids)\"/> (minors need their\n"
"                                family's ratification).</li>\n"
"                        </ul>\n"
"                        <p t-if=\"object.group_supports and object.joining_count\">\n"
"                            From the proposal in EMS (<a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.get_base_url() }}/odoo/action-ems.action_student_walkout/{{ object.id }}\">open it</a>),\n"
"                            <em>Actions &gt; Validate and justify</em> validates the proposal and justifies that day for the\n"
"                            students who can be justified (adults, and minors whose family ratified it), and <em>Do not validate</em> leaves it\n"
"                            unjustified, giving a reason.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p t-else=\"\">Nobody's absence is to be justified.</p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"<div style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">\n"
"                        <p>Hola:</p>\n"
"                        <p>\n"
"                            La votación de la huelga del <strong t-out=\"format_date(object.walkout_date)\"/> en\n"
"                            <strong t-out=\"object.group_id.name\"/> se ha cerrado. Adjuntamos el acta.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <ul>\n"
"                            <li>Voto del grupo: <t t-out=\"object.group_yes_count\"/> sí, <t t-out=\"object.group_no_count\"/> no,\n"
"                                <t t-out=\"object.group_abstain_count\"/> abstenciones.\n"
"                                <strong t-if=\"object.group_supports\">El grupo la apoya.</strong>\n"
"                                <strong t-else=\"\">El grupo no la apoya.</strong></li>\n"
"                            <li>Alumnos que se suman: <t t-out=\"object.joining_count\"/> de <t t-out=\"len(object.line_ids)\"/>;\n"
"                                se pueden justificar: <t t-out=\"len(object.justifiable_student_ids)\"/> (los menores necesitan\n"
"                                la ratificación de la familia).</li>\n"
"                        </ul>\n"
"                        <p t-if=\"object.group_supports and object.joining_count\">\n"
"                            Desde la propuesta en EMS (<a t-attf-href=\"{{ object.get_base_url() }}/odoo/action-ems.action_student_walkout/{{ object.id }}\">ábrela</a>),\n"
"                            <em>Acciones &gt; Validar y justificar</em> valida la propuesta y justifica ese día a los\n"
"                            alumnos que se pueden justificar (los mayores de edad y los menores con la ratificación de la familia), y <em>No validar</em> la deja\n"
"                            sin justificar, indicando el motivo.\n"
"                        </p>\n"
"                        <p t-else=\"\">No hay que justificar la falta de nadie.</p>\n"
"                    </div>\n"
"                \n"
"            "

#. module: ems
